# The gateway setup names the guided command, Check again answers, and the
# address field takes typed input on the on-screen keyboard.
wait-for Post
wait-for Connect a gateway
expect kobo connect post
clean
shot post-setup
tap Check again
wait-for No gateway has arrived
tap-id gateway-url
wait-for Gateway address
type hermes
expect https://hermes
clean
shot post-typed
# A plain address stays in the field with the reason under it.
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type hermes.local
tap Save gateway
wait-for Enter the secure https address of your Hermes gateway.
expect hermes.local
expect-missing No letters yet
clean
shot post-wrong-scheme
# An HTTPS address opens the inbox. With no token on the reader the first
# check says which command brings one.
tap-id gateway-url
wait-for Gateway address
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type https://hermes.example.net
tap Save gateway
wait-for No letters yet
wait-for No Hermes account is on this reader yet
expect kobo connect post
expect Page 1 · 0 letters
clean
shot post-empty-inbox
# Check asks again and says the same thing; Older and Newer have nowhere to go.
tap Check
wait-for No Hermes account is on this reader yet
tap Older
expect No letters yet
tap Newer
expect No letters yet
# The address is kept, so the next start opens the inbox, not setup.
restart
wait-for No letters yet
expect-missing Connect a gateway
# Offline with a token on the reader, the check says the reader is not on
# Wi-Fi rather than blaming the account.
companion secret set hermes-post --from apps/post/fixtures/token --sim
scenario offline
tap Check
wait-for This reader is not on Wi-Fi.
expect-missing No Hermes account
clean
shot post-offline
